            ["Start from"] = "起始",
            ["Start the Best in Slot sim here: it builds your list from every item you can wear while you take the tour (a few minutes)."] = "在这里开始BiS模拟：在你浏览导览时，它会从你能穿戴的所有物品中生成你的列表（需要几分钟）。",
