            ["Survival"] = "生存",
            ["Switch it on for your Best in Slot set, the next upgrades, the simulator and the upgrade check for loot. The settings have it too (Modules)."] = "开启后可使用BiS套装、下一批提升、模拟器和战利品提升检查。设置中也有（模块）。",
            ["Switch off the pages you do not use. Best in Slot and Wishlist also take their marks, tooltip lines and alerts with them. One module always stays on."] = "关闭你不用的页面。BiS和心愿单会连同其标记、鼠标提示行和提醒一起关闭。至少保留一个模块开启。",
            ["Switch off what you do not use: its tab goes away, Best in Slot also takes its crowns and tooltip lines with it, Wishlist its stars, tooltip mark and alerts. One module always stays on. The database look has its own pages."] = "关闭你不用的功能：其标签页会消失，BiS会连同其皇冠和鼠标提示行一起关闭，心愿单会连同星标、提示标记和提醒一起关闭。至少保留一个模块开启。数据库外观有自己的页面。",
            ["Switch on Best in Slot"] = "开启BiS",
            ["Sword"] = "剑",
            ["TANK"] = "坦克",
            ["TURN IN"] = "交还",
            ["Tabard"] = "公会徽章",
            ["Tailoring"] = "裁缝",
            ["Taken from the English collect, not asked: %d items without data, %d refused quests."] = "沿用英文收集的结果，未再查询：%d件物品无数据，%d个任务被拒绝。",
            ["Takes every item out of this set."] = "将此套装中的所有物品移除。",
            ["Talents the sim plays itself: %s."] = "模拟自行运用的天赋：%s。",
            ["Tanks wear their heaviest armor."] = "坦克穿戴其最重的护甲。",
            ["Target"] = "目标",
            ["Teal"] = "青绿",
            ["The Best in Slot module is off (Modules)."] = "BiS模块已关闭（模块）。",
            ["The Best in Slot sim is running: the small window shows how far it is. Take the tour meanwhile; your list is ready when it is done."] = "BiS模拟正在运行：小窗口显示其进度。可以先浏览导览；完成后你的列表即准备就绪。",
            ["The Journal module is off (Modules)."] = "手册模块已关闭（模块）。",
            ["The Underbelly"] = "达拉然下水道",
            ["The Wishlist module is off (Modules)."] = "心愿单模块已关闭（模块）。",
            ["The boss, rare or zone that drops it, with the chance."] = "掉落它的首领、稀有怪或地区，以及几率。",
            ["The bosses and their loot are added as soon as they are seen in the game or revealed."] = "首领及其战利品一经在游戏中发现或揭示就会添加。",
            ["The damage the sim found for the item against what you wear, or that it is on your Best in Slot list."] = "模拟得出的该物品相对当前装备的伤害，或它在你的BiS列表中。",
            ["The dungeon entrances on the world map, the alert when a wishlist item drops and opening the dungeon you are in."] = "世界地图上的地下城入口、心愿单物品掉落提醒，以及打开你所在的地下城。",
            ["The filter of your Best in Slot list: the spec it is made for, the armor it takes and where its items may come from. Open it any time: the first time it explains itself."] = "你BiS列表的过滤器：适用的专精、可选护甲以及物品可能的来源。可随时打开：首次打开时会自行说明。",
            ["The filter of your Best in Slot list: the spec it is made for, the armor it takes and where its items may come from; its second tab orders your stats. Open it any time: the first time it explains itself."] = "你BiS列表的过滤器：适用的专精、可选护甲以及物品可能的来源；第二个标签页可排列你的属性。可随时打开：首次打开时会自行说明。",
            ["The game blocked an action of Lootified (%s). /lf errors shows the details."] = "游戏阻止了Lootified的一个操作（%s）。/lf errors 显示详情。",
            ["The game does not let addons open the world map right now."] = "游戏目前不允许插件打开世界地图。",
            ["The game does not let addons open the world map right now. The spot is marked: open your world map to see it."] = "游戏目前不允许插件打开世界地图。该位置已标记：打开世界地图即可看到。",
            ["The game has no data of this item yet: press Sim again in a moment."] = "游戏尚无此物品的数据：请稍后再次点击模拟。",
            ["The game has no map data for the open world mobs yet."] = "游戏尚无野外怪物的地图数据。",
            ["The game has no map position for this spot."] = "游戏没有此位置的地图坐标。",
            ["The game has not sent all of its data yet."] = "游戏尚未发送所有数据。",
            ["The game is still loading your spell texts: try again in a moment."] = "游戏仍在载入你的法术文本：请稍后重试。",
            ["The gear button at the top right opens the settings. Pick a category on the left; every change applies at once."] = "右上角的齿轮按钮打开设置。在左侧选择类别；所有更改立即生效。",
            ["The green arrow marks the items of your Best in Slot list (sort by For you to see the best first)."] = "绿色箭头标出你BiS列表中的物品（按“为你推荐”排序可先看最佳的）。",
            ["The green arrow marks the items of your Best in Slot list, with the damage they add (sort by For you to see the biggest first)."] = "绿色箭头标出你BiS列表中的物品及其增加的伤害（按“为你推荐”排序可先看提升最大的）。",
            ["The items you starred, grouped by where they drop. You get an alert as soon as one drops."] = "你加星标的物品，按掉落地点分组。物品一掉落你就会收到提醒。",
            ["The items you starred; the stars, the tooltip mark and the alert when one drops."] = "你加星标的物品；星标、提示标记以及掉落时的提醒。",
            ["The language is under Language; this tour starts again from Tour & help or with /lf tour. Found a bug or have an idea? Website & Discord are here and behind the ? at the top. Have fun!"] = "语言在“语言”中设置；可从“导览与帮助”或用 /lf tour 重新开始本导览。发现Bug或有什么建议？网站和Discord链接在此处以及顶部的“?”后面。祝你玩得开心！",
            ["The language of the interface and of the game's names in Lootified."] = "界面及Lootified中游戏名称所用的语言。",
            ["The last collect was cut off: what it had read is kept. /lf collect again reads the rest."] = "上次收集被中断：已读取的内容已保留。再次执行/lf collect会读取剩余部分。",
            ["The level of the target dummy. It stands still, never hits back and is hit from behind."] = "训练假人的等级。它站立不动，从不反击，且从背后受到攻击。",
            ["The lines Lootified adds to item tooltips, one switch each. The preview shows a real tooltip as you set it."] = "Lootified添加到物品鼠标提示的信息行，每行一个开关。预览会按你的设置显示真实的鼠标提示。",
            ["The list of the first start: every armor your class wears, quests, dungeons and rares, drops of 10 % or more."] = "首次启动时的列表：你的职业能穿的所有护甲，任务、地下城和稀有怪，以及几率10 %及以上的掉落。",
            ["The loot of the dungeons' and raids' bosses and trash."] = "地下城和团队副本中首领和小怪的战利品。",
            ["The loot of the open world's rares and other mobs that carry the item."] = "野外稀有怪及其他携带该物品的怪物的战利品。",
            ["The picked item: its stats and where it drops (click a mob or a quest to open it)."] = "所选物品：其属性和掉落位置（点击怪物或任务可打开）。",
            ["The picked item: its stats, where it drops (click a mob or a quest to open it) and the wishlist button. You get an alert when a wishlist item drops."] = "所选物品：其属性、掉落位置（点击怪物或任务可打开）和心愿单按钮。心愿单物品掉落时你会收到提醒。",
            ["The quests that give the item or need it."] = "给予或需要该物品的任务。",
            ["The rares and mobs of every zone with their drops and camps."] = "每个地区的稀有怪和怪物，及其掉落和刷新点。",
            ["The rares and other mobs of every zone with their drops, drop chances and camps on the map. The page shows the zone you are in."] = "每个地区的稀有怪和其他怪物，及其掉落、掉落几率和地图上的刷新点。此页显示你所在的地区。",
            ["The same for bosses and rares, for quests (with their chains) and for dungeons, raids and zones. Links between the pages open the right entry."] = "首领和稀有怪、任务（含任务链）以及地下城、团队副本和地区也一样。页面间的链接会打开对应条目。",
            ["The set fights in the simulator's planner for its exact damage: the number on the sheet is an estimate from each item simmed alone."] = "套装在模拟器的规划器中战斗以得出准确伤害：表中的数值是每件物品单独模拟后的估算。",
            ["The simulator could not read your character: %s"] = "模拟器无法读取你的角色：%s",
            ["The simulator fights with your talents and gear and shows every upgrade in DPS. You run the sims yourself (the Best in Slot sim takes a few minutes): pick it only if you want that."] = "模拟器会用你的天赋和装备战斗，并以DPS显示每项提升。模拟需要你自己运行（BiS模拟需要几分钟）：仅在你需要时选择。",
            ["The simulator has no numbers for this item."] = "模拟器没有此物品的数值。",
            ["The simulator is calculating"] = "模拟器正在计算",
            ["The simulator rates your damage. Your upgrades follow your stat weights."] = "模拟器评估你的伤害。你的提升按属性权重计算。",
            ["The simulator stopped: %s"] = "模拟器已停止：%s",
            ["The target: %s"] = "目标：%s",
            ["The tour stopped because of combat. /lf tour starts it again."] = "导览因战斗而停止。/lf tour 可重新开始。",
            ["These are the bosses, numbered in their order. Click one to see its loot next to the map; click it again to close it."] = "这些是首领，按顺序编号。点击一个首领在地图旁查看其战利品；再次点击关闭。",
            ["This decides how this character's upgrades show in tooltips, loot rolls, For you and its Best in Slot list."] = "这决定了此角色的提升在鼠标提示、战利品掷骰、为你推荐及其BiS列表中如何显示。",
            ["This dungeon has more than one floor: switch between them here. Next to the buttons is the name of the floor you see."] = "这个地下城有多层：在这里切换。按钮旁边是你当前查看楼层的名称。",
            ["This is For you, your start page: the dungeons for your level with your upgrades and your next Best in Slot items. Click anything to open it."] = "这是“为你推荐”，你的起始页：适合你等级的地下城、你的提升以及你的下一批BiS物品。点击任意内容即可打开。",
            ["This is For you, your start page: the dungeons for your level. Click anything to open it."] = "这是“为你推荐”，你的起始页：适合你等级的地下城。点击任意内容即可打开。",
            ["This item is not in the loot data. It may be crafted, sold by a vendor or come from a source that is new in Forever."] = "此物品不在战利品数据中。它可能是制造的、由商人出售，或来自Forever新增的来源。",
            ["This item is not in your game client yet (datamined / upcoming)."] = "此物品尚未出现在你的游戏客户端中（数据挖掘/即将推出）。",
            ["This spec fights in Bear Form, which druids learn at level 10. Until then, pick another spec on the Best in Slot sheet."] = "此专精以熊形态战斗，德鲁伊在10级学会。在此之前，请在BiS表中选择其他专精。",
            ["This spec fights in Cat Form, which druids learn at level 20. Until then, pick another spec on the Best in Slot sheet."] = "此专精以猎豹形态战斗，德鲁伊在20级学会。在此之前，请在BiS表中选择其他专精。",
            ["This spec fights in Defensive Stance, which warriors learn at level 10. Until then, pick another spec on the Best in Slot sheet."] = "此专精以防御姿态战斗，战士在10级学会。在此之前，请在BiS表中选择其他专精。",
            ["This spec fights with a pet, which hunters get at level 10. Until then, pick another spec on the Best in Slot sheet."] = "此专精与宠物一同战斗，猎人在10级获得宠物。在此之前，请在BiS表中选择其他专精。",
            ["This spec tanks with a shield: put one on, then try again."] = "此专精用盾牌坦克：装备一面盾牌后重试。",
            ["This tour shows every part of Lootified. At the end you see the settings, where you can switch off what you do not need."] = "本导览会介绍Lootified的各个部分。最后你会看到设置，可在其中关闭不需要的功能。",
            ["Thrown"] = "投掷武器",
