            ["Try on set (Dressing Room)"] = "试穿套装（试衣间）",
            ["Try the name of a dungeon, boss, quest, zone, mob or item. Parts of words work too, e.g. \"vanc\" or \"blade\"."] = "试试地下城、首领、任务、地区、怪物或物品的名称。部分词也可以，例如“vanc”或“blade”。",
            ["Turbo"] = "极速",
            ["Turbo: %d ms per frame, the sim is done soonest, the game can run slower meanwhile."] = "极速：每帧%d毫秒，模拟最快完成，期间游戏可能变慢。",
            ["Turn in"] = "交还",
            ["Two sets of your own: click a slot to pick any item your character can put on there, or drop an item from your bags on it. The set fights on its own."] = "你的两个自定义套装：点击部位可选择你角色在该部位能装备的任意物品，或从背包拖入物品。套装单独进行战斗。",
            ["Two-Hand"] = "双手",
            ["Two-hand weapon"] = "双手武器",
            ["Two-hander in the main hand"] = "主手为双手武器",
            ["Type"] = "类型",
            ["Type /lf collect stop to cancel. Please stay logged in."] = "输入/lf collect stop取消。请保持登录。",
            ["Type /reload, then send the file WTF\\Account\\<account>\\SavedVariables\\Lootified.lua."] = "输入/reload，然后发送文件WTF\\Account\\<account>\\SavedVariables\\Lootified.lua。",
            ["Type a name, a slot or a place: the list follows as you type. The switch beside it and Sort change what shows and in which order."] = "输入名称、部位或地点：列表会随输入更新。旁边的开关和“排序”可改变显示内容及顺序。",
